{{also|Schreiben}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|schrīben}}, from {{inh|de|goh|scrīban}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*skrībaną}}, a late borrowing from {{der|de|la|scrībō||write}}, which comes from a word meaning "to scribe, to scrape". Compare {{cog|nds|schrieven}}, {{cog|nl|schrijven}}, {{cog|en|shrive}} and {{m|en|scribe}}, {{cog|fy|skriuwe}}, {{cog|da|skrive}}, {{cog|sv|skriva}}, {{cog|is|skrifa}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃʁaɪ̯bən/|[ˈʃʁaɪ̯bən]|[-ʃʁaɪ̯bm̩]|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|schrei|ben|lang=de}}
* {{a|Germany}} {{audio|De-schreiben.ogg|lang=de}}
* {{a|Austria}} {{audio|De-at-schreiben.ogg|lang=de}}

